1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,840
At the NATO summit in June, virtually all NATO members

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:06,480
formally committed to increased defense spending,

3
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:11,340
at my request, from 2 percent to 5 percent of GDP,

4
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:15,080
making our alliance far stronger and more powerful

5
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,380
than it was ever before.

6
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,960
In May, I traveled to the Middle East

7
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:23,020
to visit my friends and rebuild our partnerships in the Gulf

8
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:27,200
and those valued relationships with Saudi Arabia,

9
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:31,540
Qatar and the UAE and other countries are now,

10
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:34,380
I believe, closer than ever before.

